&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lydia Dugdale, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;M.D., MAR, Dorothy L. and Daniel H. Silberberg Professor of Medicine; Director of the Center for Clinical Medical Ethics, Columbia University Medical Center&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lauris C. Kaldjian, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;M.D., Ph.D., Director of the Program in Bioethics and Humanities, Carver College of Medicine, University of Iowa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Barbra Rothschild, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;M.D., Lecturer, Bioethics; Columbia University&lt;/li&gt;
